<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four stocks fell, one rose and eight were flat in 10.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining eight stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell one percent to 142.5 zlotys in a 7.9-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
